(7259350, 1128962, 153814, '<td valign="top">Creepy and beautiful in the same image.<br/>A creative and well thought out image will trump the technicals but it''s very rare. This is a true diamond in the rough.<br/>I think this is outstanding I could stare at this all day.<br/>I only gave one 10 in this challenge and this is it.<br/>If you get a zillion views it''s me coming back to look again and again.<br/>Very well done.</td>', 'Creepy and beautiful in the same image.A creative and well thought out image will trump the technicals but it''s very rare. This is a true diamond in the rough.I think this is outstanding I could stare at this all day.I only gave one 10 in this challenge and this is it.If you get a zillion views it''s me coming back to look again and again.Very well done.', '2014-09-05 11:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
