(7259414, 1129153, 174999, '<td valign="top">This has made one of my tops and I hope it gets good scores.<br/> <br/>I really like the creativity on this and not one is like this and I was expecting to see a lot of dress up play kind of things like this.. I like that little gold bird on his hand and that makes the picture for me, makes him look like he is watching the moon from a window, the darkness goes up against the crown and his outfit very nicely.</td>', 'This has made one of my tops and I hope it gets good scores. I really like the creativity on this and not one is like this and I was expecting to see a lot of dress up play kind of things like this.. I like that little gold bird on his hand and that makes the picture for me, makes him look like he is watching the moon from a window, the darkness goes up against the crown and his outfit very nicely.', '2014-09-05 12:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259415, 1129139, 16046, '<td valign="top">Well done</td>', 'Well done', '2014-09-05 12:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
