(7259486, 1128750, 153814, '<td valign="top">Is that a paper towel? I don''t get it, comes off as kind of goofy. Sorry just my take.</td>', 'Is that a paper towel? I don''t get it, comes off as kind of goofy. Sorry just my take.', '2014-09-05 14:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259499, 1129099, 13077, '<td valign="top">The vignetting adds to the aged feel, but I don''t care for the general lack of sharpness or the dark halos around the leaves much. I would say it could also have been improved by cropping or composing to prevent the leaf at the far left or the stalk protruding diagonally at the right.</td>', 'The vignetting adds to the aged feel, but I don''t care for the general lack of sharpness or the dark halos around the leaves much. I would say it could also have been improved by cropping or composing to prevent the leaf at the far left or the stalk protruding diagonally at the right.', '2014-09-05 14:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259500, 1129157, 13077, '<td valign="top">Good textures and tones - is this moss growing on a burnt tree? That''s the impression I get, which I can associate to the poem.</td>', 'Good textures and tones - is this moss growing on a burnt tree? That''s the impression I get, which I can associate to the poem.', '2014-09-05 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259501, 1129090, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very interesting patterns and colors. I like it.</td>', 'Very interesting patterns and colors. I like it.', '2014-09-05 14:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259504, 1129108, 13077, '<td valign="top">Well composed and I like the colors in the stone, but I might have gone with a slightly smaller aperture to increase the DOF, unless it just didn''t look very good. Hard to say.</td>', 'Well composed and I like the colors in the stone, but I might have gone with a slightly smaller aperture to increase the DOF, unless it just didn''t look very good. Hard to say.', '2014-09-05 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259505, 1129161, 13077, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I just don''t get it.</td>', 'Sorry, I just don''t get it.', '2014-09-05 15:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259507, 1129153, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely set up and executed, good literal way to represent one of the verses.</td>', 'Nicely set up and executed, good literal way to represent one of the verses.', '2014-09-05 15:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259512, 1129095, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really nice.  Issac Asimov would approve. :D</td>', 'Really nice.  Issac Asimov would approve. :D', '2014-09-05 15:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259513, 1128608, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous.</td>', 'This is gorgeous.', '2014-09-05 15:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259531, 1128643, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great Drama. Really wet and mysterious Noir feel.</td>', 'Great Drama. Really wet and mysterious Noir feel.', '2014-09-05 15:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259536, 1129139, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and tones.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and tones.', '2014-09-05 16:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259537, 1128979, 13077, '<td valign="top">Interesting find. I like the textures and patterns a lot. Is that snail on top of a barrell, or is the barrel top just on the ground?</td>', 'Interesting find. I like the textures and patterns a lot. Is that snail on top of a barrell, or is the barrel top just on the ground?', '2014-09-05 16:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259539, 1128940, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast, but the composition feels tight on the right side and the highlights under the chin detract a bit.</td>', 'Nice contrast, but the composition feels tight on the right side and the highlights under the chin detract a bit.', '2014-09-05 16:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259546, 1129100, 13077, '<td valign="top">Interesting array of lines and angles. I like the positioning of the man surrounded by the bars tightly on all sides.</td>', 'Interesting array of lines and angles. I like the positioning of the man surrounded by the bars tightly on all sides.', '2014-09-05 16:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259547, 1129156, 13077, '<td valign="top">Personally I think the composition could have been improved by cropping it lower to remove the armpit and the lower part of her face.</td>', 'Personally I think the composition could have been improved by cropping it lower to remove the armpit and the lower part of her face.', '2014-09-05 16:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259548, 1129147, 13077, '<td valign="top">I very much like the pattern of the man''s shirt against the pattern of the bay doors. I can''t decide if I like the perspective as much, I think it might have been improved by shooting straight on at the building as he walked past, but then again it may look better this way.</td>', 'I very much like the pattern of the man''s shirt against the pattern of the bay doors. I can''t decide if I like the perspective as much, I think it might have been improved by shooting straight on at the building as he walked past, but then again it may look better this way.', '2014-09-05 16:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259549, 1129136, 13077, '<td valign="top">I can''t say I''m a fan of the processing on this one - the halos are very pronounced and there doesn''t seem to be anything sharp.</td>', 'I can''t say I''m a fan of the processing on this one - the halos are very pronounced and there doesn''t seem to be anything sharp.', '2014-09-05 16:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259565, 1129154, 13077, '<td valign="top">This photo is full of gritty details and the lighting and composition work very well. I like it a lot, can''t really think of anything to improve.</td>', 'This photo is full of gritty details and the lighting and composition work very well. I like it a lot, can''t really think of anything to improve.', '2014-09-05 17:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259568, 1129097, 13077, '<td valign="top">Simple and pleasant photo to look at - is the concept that our protagonist is sinking to his finale before making it to his material destination?</td>', 'Simple and pleasant photo to look at - is the concept that our protagonist is sinking to his finale before making it to his material destination?', '2014-09-05 17:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259628, 1128771, 96751, '<td valign="top">Marvelous entry</td>', 'Marvelous entry', '2014-09-05 19:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259629, 1129154, 170281, '<td valign="top">On target with the theme and awesome photo.  The framing is great and the black and white makes is more dramatic.</td>', 'On target with the theme and awesome photo.  The framing is great and the black and white makes is more dramatic.', '2014-09-05 19:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259720, 1129143, 13077, '<td valign="top">The tones look good, but I''m not a fan of the processing.</td>', 'The tones look good, but I''m not a fan of the processing.', '2014-09-06 00:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259721, 1128980, 13077, '<td valign="top">I think the sharpening was a little too heavy-handed on this one, and if it would have been possible to move to the left and avoid the black mass of trees to the bottom right it would probably have looker more appealing.</td>', 'I think the sharpening was a little too heavy-handed on this one, and if it would have been possible to move to the left and avoid the black mass of trees to the bottom right it would probably have looker more appealing.', '2014-09-06 00:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259722, 1129005, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the gritty details, and the dynamic range is perfect to leave the highlights mysteriously void of detail.</td>', 'I like the gritty details, and the dynamic range is perfect to leave the highlights mysteriously void of detail.', '2014-09-06 00:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259723, 1129115, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very appealing photo, although the HDR effect is a little too strong for my taste.</td>', 'Very appealing photo, although the HDR effect is a little too strong for my taste.', '2014-09-06 00:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259724, 1129163, 13077, '<td valign="top">And then he forgot about his boat :)</td>', 'And then he forgot about his boat :)', '2014-09-06 00:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259725, 1129144, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot for the simplicity. The composition and crop seem just right, and I like the faint vignette effect and the tones in the sky and water.</td>', 'I like this a lot for the simplicity. The composition and crop seem just right, and I like the faint vignette effect and the tones in the sky and water.', '2014-09-06 00:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259726, 1128962, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Good job of keeping exposed well and the water adds some interesting colors and details to the scene. Makes me wonder how many takes were required and how exasperated the subject got towards the end :)</td>', 'Very cool. Good job of keeping exposed well and the water adds some interesting colors and details to the scene. Makes me wonder how many takes were required and how exasperated the subject got towards the end :)', '2014-09-06 00:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259727, 1129152, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the overall old-timey feel of the photo and the interpretation of the challenge, but the crop seems a bit tight and I think it might have benefitted by at least including all of the framed photo on the right, if not all of the piano.</td>', 'I like the overall old-timey feel of the photo and the interpretation of the challenge, but the crop seems a bit tight and I think it might have benefitted by at least including all of the framed photo on the right, if not all of the piano.', '2014-09-06 00:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259728, 1129166, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the high-altitude dark sky and the frosted mountains, but feel it would be a much better photo with the people much closer to the camera.</td>', 'I like the high-altitude dark sky and the frosted mountains, but feel it would be a much better photo with the people much closer to the camera.', '2014-09-06 00:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259729, 1128771, 13077, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it... Interesting processing, I will have to check back and see how you did that. <br/>As far as the photo itself goes, I think the composition is good but it could have been better to have the woman positioned in between the people walking rather that butted up against two of them when viewed two-dimensionally.</td>', 'I don''t get it... Interesting processing, I will have to check back and see how you did that. As far as the photo itself goes, I think the composition is good but it could have been better to have the woman positioned in between the people walking rather that butted up against two of them when viewed two-dimensionally.', '2014-09-06 00:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259730, 1128850, 13077, '<td valign="top">Wow. Hope the cloud didn''t come your way after you took this. Particulates in the air always make for such dramatic photos, well captured.</td>', 'Wow. Hope the cloud didn''t come your way after you took this. Particulates in the air always make for such dramatic photos, well captured.', '2014-09-06 00:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259731, 1128750, 13077, '<td valign="top">I realize they are probably hard to come by, but fabric like a real shemagh would have completed this photo. Now the only thing I notice is.. are they paper towels?</td>', 'I realize they are probably hard to come by, but fabric like a real shemagh would have completed this photo. Now the only thing I notice is.. are they paper towels?', '2014-09-06 00:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259732, 1128566, 13077, '<td valign="top">Good concept. I think the black background doesn''t fit too well here, a wood grain surface might have worked better to complete the scene.</td>', 'Good concept. I think the black background doesn''t fit too well here, a wood grain surface might have worked better to complete the scene.', '2014-09-06 00:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259733, 1129095, 13077, '<td valign="top">Wow, cool. But how are stars coving the dark side of the moon?</td>', 'Wow, cool. But how are stars coving the dark side of the moon?', '2014-09-06 00:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259734, 1129159, 13077, '<td valign="top">This could have improved by composing to avoid the tree for a cleaner background. Also, the statue might have been soft to begin with, or it was over processed and made it look that way, I can''t really tell. I don''t know that I''m a fan of the sepia tone on this one either.</td>', 'This could have improved by composing to avoid the tree for a cleaner background. Also, the statue might have been soft to begin with, or it was over processed and made it look that way, I can''t really tell. I don''t know that I''m a fan of the sepia tone on this one either.', '2014-09-06 00:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259736, 1129160, 13077, '<td valign="top">I do like the tones, but it has an accidental feel and I can''t tell what the subject is or how it relates to the theme. It takes a lot of practice and certain conditions to pull off a good shot from a moving vehicle.</td>', 'I do like the tones, but it has an accidental feel and I can''t tell what the subject is or how it relates to the theme. It takes a lot of practice and certain conditions to pull off a good shot from a moving vehicle.', '2014-09-06 00:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259737, 1129106, 13077, '<td valign="top">Must be a 4x4 bus. :)</td>', 'Must be a 4x4 bus. :)', '2014-09-06 00:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259738, 1129078, 13077, '<td valign="top">Ordinarily I would say the man''s face in the foreground on the right should have been left out, but the way it fits into the scene is great. I like this a lot.</td>', 'Ordinarily I would say the man''s face in the foreground on the right should have been left out, but the way it fits into the scene is great. I like this a lot.', '2014-09-06 00:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259739, 1129073, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like this - nice atmosphere and tones, but I don''t know that I''m a fan of the fence in the foreground.</td>', 'I like this - nice atmosphere and tones, but I don''t know that I''m a fan of the fence in the foreground.', '2014-09-06 00:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259740, 1129102, 13077, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t people miss lunch and dinner?</td>', 'Wouldn''t people miss lunch and dinner?', '2014-09-06 00:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259741, 1129148, 13077, '<td valign="top">I really like scenes like this, and you picked a great moment to capture it. I also like the way the tree is being blown by the wind, but I wonder how it would look if the top of the tree had a little more space.</td>', 'I really like scenes like this, and you picked a great moment to capture it. I also like the way the tree is being blown by the wind, but I wonder how it would look if the top of the tree had a little more space.', '2014-09-06 00:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259742, 1128692, 13077, '<td valign="top">Good depth of field and I like the sand under the stand.</td>', 'Good depth of field and I like the sand under the stand.', '2014-09-06 01:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259743, 1129162, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very interesting abstract, I like the tones and it fits that verse well.</td>', 'Very interesting abstract, I like the tones and it fits that verse well.', '2014-09-06 01:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259744, 1129133, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very cool, very dramatic photo</td>', 'Very cool, very dramatic photo', '2014-09-06 01:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259745, 1129141, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the patterns in the waves.</td>', 'I like the composition and the patterns in the waves.', '2014-09-06 01:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259746, 1128830, 13077, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on that verse. I hope for the cowboy''s sake he wasn''t actually dying, but that bull looks like a rough one.</td>', 'Interesting take on that verse. I hope for the cowboy''s sake he wasn''t actually dying, but that bull looks like a rough one.', '2014-09-06 01:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259747, 1129167, 13077, '<td valign="top">Well timed photo but it would have been so much better if it were in focus.</td>', 'Well timed photo but it would have been so much better if it were in focus.', '2014-09-06 01:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259748, 1129165, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the textures but with the processing it''s just hard to look at.</td>', 'I like the textures but with the processing it''s just hard to look at.', '2014-09-06 01:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259749, 1129056, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice - I like the B&amp;W conversion and the darkness of the background compared to the birds. Very well timed as well.</td>', 'Nice - I like the B&W conversion and the darkness of the background compared to the birds. Very well timed as well.', '2014-09-06 01:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259750, 1129132, 13077, '<td valign="top">To go B&amp;W was a good choice for this one, and I like the way it was converted. I think the composition could have been slightly improved if there was a way to eliminate the dish on the far right, though.</td>', 'To go B&W was a good choice for this one, and I like the way it was converted. I think the composition could have been slightly improved if there was a way to eliminate the dish on the far right, though.', '2014-09-06 01:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259752, 1129070, 13077, '<td valign="top">Took me a while to see the guy''s head in there, it was just so unusual. Very cool.</td>', 'Took me a while to see the guy''s head in there, it was just so unusual. Very cool.', '2014-09-06 01:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259753, 1129164, 13077, '<td valign="top">This has a lot of dramatic elements, but I think it would have been better if you had found a way to keep all the mystique and drama and still keep the coat sharply focused.</td>', 'This has a lot of dramatic elements, but I think it would have been better if you had found a way to keep all the mystique and drama and still keep the coat sharply focused.', '2014-09-06 01:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259754, 1128523, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very well done, that light source must have been pretty dim to be able to capture the galaxies so brightly. I like it a lot.</td>', 'Very well done, that light source must have been pretty dim to be able to capture the galaxies so brightly. I like it a lot.', '2014-09-06 01:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259755, 1129101, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the environment and composition of this photo a lot, but I don''t get it.</td>', 'I like the environment and composition of this photo a lot, but I don''t get it.', '2014-09-06 01:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259757, 1128608, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic editing and well executed, but I''m still trying to figure out what the subject is.</td>', 'Very dramatic editing and well executed, but I''m still trying to figure out what the subject is.', '2014-09-06 01:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
