(7259759, 1128643, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I love the way the fog is captured and the patterns in the water, even the very dark foreground.</td>', 'Very cool. I love the way the fog is captured and the patterns in the water, even the very dark foreground.', '2014-09-06 01:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259760, 1128617, 13077, '<td valign="top">Literally. Nicely done bird-in-nature shot, maybe a little less contrast to reveal more detail in the bird would have been nice but from the grain I''m guessing it was a pretty high ISO shot - always takes a toll on dynamic range.</td>', 'Literally. Nicely done bird-in-nature shot, maybe a little less contrast to reveal more detail in the bird would have been nice but from the grain I''m guessing it was a pretty high ISO shot - always takes a toll on dynamic range.', '2014-09-06 01:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259761, 1128705, 13077, '<td valign="top">I think it would be better had the foreground cross been in focus. Looks like you were close to the ground, no reason not to use an aperture allowing full depth of field. I also would have suggested eliminating the out-of-focus object at center left.</td>', 'I think it would be better had the foreground cross been in focus. Looks like you were close to the ground, no reason not to use an aperture allowing full depth of field. I also would have suggested eliminating the out-of-focus object at center left.', '2014-09-06 01:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
