(7259764, 1129155, 13077, '<td valign="top">Interesting take. The idea I get is that you are pointing out how the man in the background seems to be disinterested, despite the shining gilded ship. Maybe that''s what you were going for, I don''t know.</td>', 'Interesting take. The idea I get is that you are pointing out how the man in the background seems to be disinterested, despite the shining gilded ship. Maybe that''s what you were going for, I don''t know.', '2014-09-06 01:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
