(7261808, 1129161, 149964, '<td valign="top">Ok, if I''m being honest,  I think I need to to understand your mind &amp; thinking better.....I might then be able to interpret and comment with more confidence.</td>', 'Ok, if I''m being honest,  I think I need to to understand your mind & thinking better.....I might then be able to interpret and comment with more confidence.', '2014-09-10 17:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
