(7262286, 1129078, 156466, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ozerad:</b></div><hr/><i> Definitely paltry! Is this a relative of yours? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Why, does he look like me? ;)  No.  Nothing posed here.  Hadn''t seen him before, haven''t seen him since.</td>', 'Originally posted by ozerad: Definitely paltry! Is this a relative of yours?   Why, does he look like me? ;)  No.  Nothing posed here.  Hadn''t seen him before, haven''t seen him since.', '2014-09-12 03:10:52.000000', NULL, 0),
