(7262348, 1128643, 63218, '<td valign="top">Lots of bridge pictures in this world. Lots on DPC. This one is different. The bridge seems natural, like it grew there. I like it. I gave it a 9 because although I know why I would''ve left the floating bits in, I disagree with myself, I don''t like them there. Anyway, I came back to fav this one because it reminds me of those lovely early black and white photographs by photography''s forefathers.</td>', 'Lots of bridge pictures in this world. Lots on DPC. This one is different. The bridge seems natural, like it grew there. I like it. I gave it a 9 because although I know why I would''ve left the floating bits in, I disagree with myself, I don''t like them there. Anyway, I came back to fav this one because it reminds me of those lovely early black and white photographs by photography''s forefathers.', '2014-09-12 10:05:17.000000', NULL, 0),
