(7263385, 1129161, 124815, '<td valign="top">I thought of  this being yours but could not bring myself together to make a comment. On one hand was so happy to see your stuff back, on the other hand the sinking feeling of the photograph stopped me from saying anything. And yet, the left hand side of the shot is Byzantium and it is ascending.</td>', 'I thought of  this being yours but could not bring myself together to make a comment. On one hand was so happy to see your stuff back, on the other hand the sinking feeling of the photograph stopped me from saying anything. And yet, the left hand side of the shot is Byzantium and it is ascending.', '2014-09-15 23:28:42.000000', NULL, 0),
